WEBVTT

00:00:04.630 --> 00:00:06.530
The Royal Tutor, Heine.

00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:11.440
His task is to groom four
princes for the throne.

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:12.270
However...

00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:16.170
I don't accept you, got it?

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:21.520
They are problem children who have driven
away their many previous royal tutors.

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:25.480
It is not my job to win you over.

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:29.230
I will see you in the reception
hall at four o'clock.

00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:33.890
I will only begin my lessons if I
am able to gather you all together.

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:08.850
You Don't Need to Accept Me

00:02:08.570 --> 00:02:11.770
I've finished grading the princes' tests.

00:02:11.770 --> 00:02:14.070
Ten minutes until our appointment.

00:02:14.890 --> 00:02:18.170
Will all the princes come?

00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:30.120
That runt of a tutor will be done
with his interviews by now, huh?

00:02:30.610 --> 00:02:34.620
Well, when we shun him,
he'll jump ship like all the others anyway.

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:38.330
Blast it. Only nine minutes left.

00:02:40.620 --> 00:02:42.000
Leonhard?

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:44.520
Leonhard!

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:47.340
Why are you on the swing right now?

00:02:47.340 --> 00:02:49.520
Ah, Bruno...

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:55.570
In nine minutes... No, eight now...
Master's first lesson will begin.

00:02:55.570 --> 00:02:59.320
It's only polite that we be there
waiting for him as soon as we can.

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:02.690
Master? Who's that?

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:05.650
Professor Heine.

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:09.130
Come again? Are you joking, Bruno?

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:12.540
Didn't you say you wouldn't
accept him a few hours ago?

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:14.850
I was a fool.

00:03:14.850 --> 00:03:15.500
Huh?

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:19.540
Spending time with Master opened my eyes.

00:03:20.270 --> 00:03:24.010
I've never seen such brilliance before.

00:03:25.060 --> 00:03:26.970
Please let me call you my master!

00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:28.930
Brother...

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:32.910
Leonhard, Master is a truly talented man.

00:03:32.910 --> 00:03:36.350
Yet he is also a humble man
of great character.

00:03:36.350 --> 00:03:37.150
You should also—

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:38.800
I won't accept him!

00:03:39.090 --> 00:03:43.390
I will never accept that teacher,
even if <i>you</i> tell me to!

00:03:43.390 --> 00:03:45.010
Wait, Leonhard!

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:47.770
Nine more minutes.

00:03:49.430 --> 00:03:51.160
Wait, still?

00:03:51.590 --> 00:03:54.960
Dear God! My pocket watch stopped!

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:02.790
Three more minutes.

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:06.480
Master!

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:09.550
I am terribly sorry for arriving late.

00:04:09.550 --> 00:04:15.000
No need to apologize. It is
still before four o'clock.

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:15.550
No...

00:04:15.550 --> 00:04:17.880
I assumed it was fundamental to be at least

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:20.400
ten minutes early for my
master's very first lesson.

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:23.870
More fundamentally, would you
please stop calling me master?

00:04:23.870 --> 00:04:26.560
Especially in front of your brothers.
It is embarrassing.

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:30.250
F-Forgive my blunder!
Master... I mean, Professor!

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:33.240
I will be sure to call you
Professor henceforth.

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:36.080
Yoo-hoo, Heine darling!

00:04:36.950 --> 00:04:38.830
H-Heine darling?

00:04:38.830 --> 00:04:40.080
Prince Licht.

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:43.160
Thanks for entertaining
my lady friends earlier.

00:04:43.160 --> 00:04:43.920
Excuse me?!

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:44.460
Huh?

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:48.000
Why are you speaking so impolitely
to Ma... the professor?

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:51.560
Aw, who cares? You're so rigid, Bruni.

00:04:51.870 --> 00:04:56.940
You will respect Ma... the professor! Even if
Ma... the professor does not chide you for it!

00:04:56.940 --> 00:05:00.200
Like, what's this "master,
master" thing about?

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:04.180
You don't care whether I call you
Professor or Heine darling, right?

00:05:04.180 --> 00:05:07.240
'Cause we're pals. Yay!

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:09.010
Wh— How rude!

00:05:09.010 --> 00:05:13.210
And enviable, enviable, enviable...!

00:05:13.210 --> 00:05:16.120
Please calm yourself, Prince Bruno.

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:18.690
I do not mind if you speak to me informally.

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:21.890
You are all of a much
higher station than myself.

00:05:21.890 --> 00:05:23.200
Told you so!

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:26.490
Ah, but would you kindly stop
putting your arm around me?

00:05:26.490 --> 00:05:32.670
I'd like to build a bond of trust with you,
as simply a teacher and his students.

00:05:32.670 --> 00:05:35.650
Also, would you kindly not crowd me?

00:05:35.650 --> 00:05:38.810
Hey! You really are being cold to me!

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:41.680
Hmph. You brought it upon yourself.

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:43.890
Always so indecent... It's a disgrace.

00:05:43.890 --> 00:05:46.540
Oh, boy. Here we go with
the complaining again.

00:05:46.540 --> 00:05:49.860
Excuse me? Your indecency goes too far.

00:05:49.860 --> 00:05:52.800
Every day you bring strange
women to your room!

00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:53.700
Two more minutes.

00:05:53.280 --> 00:05:55.700
Like you're one to talk.

00:05:56.440 --> 00:05:58.740
Professor. I'm here.

00:05:59.030 --> 00:06:02.510
What's your problem? Don't get sour
'cause I've got game and you don't.

00:05:59.350 --> 00:06:02.510
Prince Kai. Do come in.

00:06:02.510 --> 00:06:04.160
What?! Say that again, I dare you!

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:06.010
Hard-headed know-it-all!

00:06:06.010 --> 00:06:07.700
Irresponsible playboy!

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:11.170
Ugh, I can't believe I have such
a super annoying big brother.

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:15.630
Well! I'd be happy to be rid of a
rotten little brother like you.

00:06:14.280 --> 00:06:15.630
<i>One more minute.</i>

00:06:15.630 --> 00:06:17.710
Right back at you.

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:19.280
Oh?! Sit down.

00:06:19.280 --> 00:06:22.190
I'll straighten you out!

00:06:29.480 --> 00:06:31.330
You're all good boys!

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:33.830
Bruno and Licht are both good boys.

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:38.210
My apologies, Kai. I lost my cool.

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:41.040
Me, too. Sorry, Kai.

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:42.110
They stopped.

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:44.200
You're all good boys.

00:06:44.680 --> 00:06:48.420
So you are the mediator for
your brothers, Prince Kai?

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:53.420
I love my brothers.
I want us all to get along.

00:06:53.420 --> 00:06:56.430
Kai is so pure that we can't argue with him.

00:06:56.820 --> 00:06:58.430
What he said.

00:06:59.550 --> 00:07:02.250
With you, too.

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:03.770
Why, thank you.

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:14.610
Only Prince Leonhard didn't come, then?

00:07:14.610 --> 00:07:18.710
Anyway, should we get started without Leo?

00:07:18.710 --> 00:07:23.220
No. Our first lesson is
to be a group lesson.

00:07:23.220 --> 00:07:27.060
But we are missing a prince.
Let's put today's lesson on hold.

00:07:27.060 --> 00:07:28.630
What?! But...!

00:07:29.120 --> 00:07:31.290
I'll find him at once!

00:07:33.230 --> 00:07:33.960
Ah.

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:36.120
Leonhard?

00:07:37.400 --> 00:07:39.270
You came?

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:43.790
D-Don't misunderstand! I'm only here to
see the look of defeat on your face.

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:46.180
It's not like Licht or Kai came anyway—

00:07:46.180 --> 00:07:47.490
Yay!

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:51.560
Wh-Why do you look all chummy?!

00:07:51.560 --> 00:07:52.980
Get in here, Leo.

00:07:52.980 --> 00:07:58.060
Wh— Licht! Kai! Weren't you both
against the royal tutor, too?

00:07:58.060 --> 00:07:59.440
You traitors!

00:07:59.440 --> 00:08:02.730
Yeah, but I've taken a liking to the guy.

00:08:02.730 --> 00:08:03.710
Me, too.

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:05.910
Wh-What happened?

00:08:05.910 --> 00:08:09.120
My lady friends will be
excited with him around.

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:11.670
Squee! Heine darling, you're so cute.

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:14.790
I can't believe you... And you, Kai?

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:20.010
The professor is small... cute... soft...

00:08:20.010 --> 00:08:22.290
Rub, rub, rub...

00:08:21.090 --> 00:08:25.970
How could you possibly get
this friendly so quickly?

00:08:26.320 --> 00:08:31.120
Now that Prince Leonhard has joined us,
let us begin the lesson.

00:08:31.430 --> 00:08:36.170
In the future, I will be conducting individual
lessons tailored to your unique needs.

00:08:36.170 --> 00:08:38.860
First, I will be returning
your competency tests.

00:08:38.860 --> 00:08:42.980
Wh-What? That's not what
I'm here for. I'm leaving!

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:47.340
Now, now, Leo. If you took it,
you may as well hear your grade.

00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:50.800
Let's see which of us scored higher.

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:54.220
Let me go, idiot! Let go!

00:08:52.620 --> 00:08:55.340
Ahem... Then I will begin with Prince Bruno.

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:56.320
One hundred points.

00:08:56.320 --> 00:08:57.480
Naturally.

00:08:57.480 --> 00:08:59.220
Ew. Creepy.

00:08:59.220 --> 00:09:01.040
Next, Prince Kai.

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:02.480
Eighty-seven points.

00:09:02.970 --> 00:09:04.180
Normal.

00:09:04.180 --> 00:09:05.750
Hey, that's really good!

00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:09.220
It should be no surprise.
Kai has always earned good marks.

00:09:09.220 --> 00:09:10.020
He has?

00:09:10.330 --> 00:09:11.690
Prince Licht.

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:12.810
Sixty points.

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:16.520
Uh-oh. I'm in trouble if I
did this bad on the basics.

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:18.670
And finally, Prince Leonhard.

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:19.700
One point.

00:09:23.650 --> 00:09:27.990
No, that can't be possible. Even for
someone who has difficulty studying...

00:09:27.990 --> 00:09:29.660
Let me see it.

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:33.240
G-Good God...

00:09:34.600 --> 00:09:38.820
It must be a mistake. Writing all your
answers in the wrong place is common.

00:09:38.820 --> 00:09:39.760
He didn't.

00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:45.180
Then were you too upset about
something to concentrate?

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:46.960
He's been in a great mood lately, right?

00:09:48.550 --> 00:09:51.770
Then... You were late for
the test and had no time!

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:54.160
I gave him equal time.

00:09:56.230 --> 00:09:58.000
How is this possible?

00:09:58.000 --> 00:10:00.280
He answered every question...

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:02.110
and every one of them is wrong.

00:10:02.110 --> 00:10:05.400
What's more, his one point is a
pity point for writing his name.

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:09.490
Leo, is this for real?
Aren't you in serious trouble.

00:10:10.510 --> 00:10:13.790
D-Don't laugh at me! This is why
I didn't want to take a test.

00:10:15.470 --> 00:10:18.970
I can shut Licht up,
but I can't find any words.

00:10:21.940 --> 00:10:27.780
It's okay. You're a good boy.
And a great athlete.

00:10:27.780 --> 00:10:29.140
Kai...

00:10:29.140 --> 00:10:34.660
Riding. Hunting. Sports.
You're amazing at all of them.

00:10:34.660 --> 00:10:36.670
I-I am, aren't I?

00:10:36.670 --> 00:10:39.350
I can just do my best in other areas.

00:10:40.210 --> 00:10:41.760
Thanks, Kai.

00:10:41.760 --> 00:10:43.440
Well said, Kai!

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:47.740
Still, this grade is horrendous,
Prince Leonhard.

00:10:48.440 --> 00:10:49.650
But Your Highness—

00:10:49.650 --> 00:10:53.080
This humiliation... It's all your fault.

00:10:53.680 --> 00:10:56.250
You made me take that test...

00:10:56.720 --> 00:10:57.860
I knew it.

00:10:58.210 --> 00:10:59.360
I knew it.

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:03.150
Teachers are the enemy!

00:11:01.990 --> 00:11:03.140
Leonhard!

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:04.640
Leo!

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:05.950
Uh, he's fast!

00:11:16.300 --> 00:11:19.610
No one can catch up to Leo at full speed.

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:22.670
I doubt he'll return for some time.

00:11:22.960 --> 00:11:27.170
Professor, I sincerely
apologize for my brother.

00:11:27.170 --> 00:11:30.470
No, I was inconsiderate.

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:32.960
Eh, this is nothing new.

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:36.960
He's always hated studying. He'd hop
on a horse and ride away all the time.

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:42.090
Really? How did Prince Leonhard
come to hate his studies so?

00:11:44.070 --> 00:11:48.960
It's not only the studying
he hates. It's the teachers.

00:11:48.960 --> 00:11:50.440
Could you elaborate?

00:11:51.350 --> 00:11:56.190
His first royal tutor, when he was
very young, was exceedingly strict.

00:12:03.940 --> 00:12:07.110
Why can't you answer such simple questions?

00:12:07.570 --> 00:12:08.910
I'm sorry!

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:15.660
Do you know why you're the only
one who has to study this much?

00:12:15.660 --> 00:12:18.630
It is because, unlike your brothers,
you're a dunce.

00:12:19.660 --> 00:12:23.640
Studying was always more difficult for Leonhard,
so the tutor singled him out.

00:12:23.640 --> 00:12:25.770
It wounded his heart.

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:30.670
After that, he began to instinctively hate
all teachers and see them as enemies.

00:12:30.670 --> 00:12:32.920
I'm not gonna study!

00:12:32.920 --> 00:12:34.260
That's enough! Stop!

00:12:34.260 --> 00:12:36.050
Are you going to run away again?!

00:12:36.050 --> 00:12:38.310
Oh, shut up! Hyah!

00:12:47.610 --> 00:12:52.120
It is not that he thinks
badly of you personally.

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:55.420
Then I will teach him.

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:56.160
Huh?

00:12:57.040 --> 00:13:02.330
A teacher's task is not to wound a
student's heart, but to nurture hope.

00:13:02.330 --> 00:13:04.990
I am his royal tutor.

00:13:05.650 --> 00:13:09.220
I will teach him that
teachers are not the enemy.

00:13:16.720 --> 00:13:18.600
Professor, what are you...?

00:13:20.950 --> 00:13:22.860
No way! Professor, this is the third floor!

00:13:23.520 --> 00:13:24.190
Professor!

00:13:25.160 --> 00:13:28.670
Master!

00:13:26.770 --> 00:13:27.640
Huh?

00:13:27.640 --> 00:13:28.670
Master?

00:13:32.900 --> 00:13:36.520
When I'm moving,
I can forget the bad things.

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:46.170
Looking back, none of the royal
tutors could ever catch me.

00:13:49.790 --> 00:13:50.690
Prince.

00:13:51.840 --> 00:13:53.170
Prince Leonhard.

00:14:03.010 --> 00:14:06.080
That's not how you ride a horse!

00:14:06.600 --> 00:14:09.360
My apologies for this embarrassing display.

00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:14.610
My feet would not reach the stirrups.
I ask that you forgive my improper technique.

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:16.620
Stay away!

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:19.930
Would you kindly stop your horse?

00:14:19.930 --> 00:14:21.850
Talk with me.

00:14:21.850 --> 00:14:23.790
I can't believe you're riding like that!

00:14:24.280 --> 00:14:26.860
It's scary. Don't come any closer, you fool!

00:14:26.860 --> 00:14:29.420
If you will not stop,
you leave me little choice.

00:14:29.420 --> 00:14:31.090
This lesson...

00:14:31.980 --> 00:14:33.840
will be a bit rough.

00:14:34.510 --> 00:14:35.310
Huh?

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:49.980
My sincerest apologies for
taking this so far.

00:14:50.710 --> 00:14:53.610
The faster a misunderstanding
is corrected, the better.

00:14:53.940 --> 00:14:59.050
I chose the safest timing based on the
speed of our horses, our angle of descent,

00:14:59.050 --> 00:15:01.530
and the presence of shrubbery for cushioning.

00:15:01.530 --> 00:15:04.170
I believe you should not be hurt.

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:05.080
Oh my.

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:09.880
No way. You caught up to me with
that insane way of riding?

00:15:10.370 --> 00:15:12.350
What <i>are</i> you?!

00:15:12.350 --> 00:15:16.080
No teacher has ever caught up to me before.

00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:21.880
I am bound to secrecy regarding my origins.

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:27.730
However, I can teach you why
I was able to catch you.

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:35.990
It's because I am different from the royal
tutors that came before me, Your Highness.

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:43.200
I do not intend to blame you
whatsoever for your poor marks.

00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:47.640
Liar! You said my grade on
that test was horrendous.

00:15:47.640 --> 00:15:51.090
It is a teacher's job to change that, no?

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:57.180
My lessons will not stop
at general education.

00:15:57.180 --> 00:16:00.050
Manners, martial arts, and so on...
We will cover diverse subjects.

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:03.070
Prince Bruno will have lessons
in sociology and philosophy.

00:16:03.070 --> 00:16:06.800
Prince Licht will study social
intercourse and anthropology.

00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:09.350
Each of your studies will complement

00:16:09.350 --> 00:16:13.990
your individual character, to develop your
unique talents in preparation for the throne.

00:16:15.360 --> 00:16:18.260
You have many talents yourself.

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:21.650
Riding. Hunting. Track and field.

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:26.580
I believe you also have a keen
awareness of your own weaknesses.

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:33.210
I'm hopeless. A lost cause. Trash.

00:16:35.880 --> 00:16:38.370
Those who know their own vulnerability

00:16:38.370 --> 00:16:43.440
can grow to be stout-hearted people who
are kind and sensitive to others' pain.

00:16:44.970 --> 00:16:49.680
I meant to tell you not to
be disheartened by today's test,

00:16:49.680 --> 00:16:51.400
but you took flight before I could.

00:16:52.730 --> 00:16:54.440
You did...?

00:16:54.440 --> 00:16:57.550
May I ask you something, Your Highness?

00:16:58.190 --> 00:17:03.380
Has running from your problems ever
made your heart feel lighter?

00:17:03.380 --> 00:17:04.070
Huh?

00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:09.390
I believe you already know that
running will not change things.

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:16.570
You do not need to accept me
as the royal tutor right away.

00:17:17.310 --> 00:17:18.220
But...

00:17:19.500 --> 00:17:25.360
If you want to stop running away,
won't you take my hand and try, little by little?

00:17:43.840 --> 00:17:45.440
And what is this?

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:49.770
As a reward for catching me, I...

00:17:50.320 --> 00:17:54.090
I suppose I can try this much.

00:17:57.500 --> 00:17:58.960
Understood.

00:18:01.250 --> 00:18:06.090
I look forward to our lessons together,
Prince Leonhard.

00:18:13.790 --> 00:18:16.150
Wait a minute. The sun's going down!

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:17.400
So it seems.

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:20.650
Let's go back. My brothers and
grandmother will be worried.

00:18:20.650 --> 00:18:22.010
Yes, but...

00:18:22.010 --> 00:18:24.340
Huh? Where are we?

00:18:24.820 --> 00:18:28.200
Some hours away from the palace on foot.

00:18:28.200 --> 00:18:30.790
It will be difficult to
return without horses.

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:31.900
What?

00:18:31.900 --> 00:18:34.370
Patrizia! Where are you?

00:18:35.740 --> 00:18:38.540
Patrizia! Come back!

00:18:43.140 --> 00:18:46.320
Hey. The horses aren't coming back.

00:18:46.700 --> 00:18:48.050
So it seems.

00:18:48.900 --> 00:18:50.500
That's all you have to say?

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:56.150
Why can't you find Master or Leonhard?

00:18:56.150 --> 00:18:57.150
I'm terribly sorry.

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:59.420
Fine. I'll search for them myself!

00:18:59.420 --> 00:19:01.030
Your Highness, please wait!

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:05.120
The roads are dangerous at night.
We guards will search for them.

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:08.910
I can't leave Master waiting
in such a dangerous place!

00:19:08.910 --> 00:19:13.030
Eh, this always happens.
Won't they be back in the morning?

00:19:20.020 --> 00:19:21.250
Why?

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:25.080
Why do I, a prince, have to sleep outside?!

00:19:25.080 --> 00:19:27.300
Because you fled quite far.

00:19:27.300 --> 00:19:29.480
You're the one who lost the horses!

00:19:29.480 --> 00:19:30.640
You could say that.

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:34.710
Aha. I found wild berries.
They're nice and ripe.

00:19:35.330 --> 00:19:36.430
Yes. They are sweet.

00:19:36.430 --> 00:19:38.390
Won't you pick them with me, Your Highness?

00:19:38.390 --> 00:19:41.410
Those are for birds! I can't eat that.

00:19:41.410 --> 00:19:43.440
Ah, there are acorns as well.

00:19:43.440 --> 00:19:45.820
These are splendid when roasted.

00:19:45.820 --> 00:19:49.000
Come, we must forage for food
or we will go hungry tonight.

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:54.330
Shut up! I want to eat sachertorte!
I'm not eating stupid acorns!

00:19:54.970 --> 00:19:58.320
Bah! I don't need a royal tutor!

00:19:58.320 --> 00:20:00.790
Get out! Now!

00:20:00.790 --> 00:20:03.970
Oh? How am I to "get out" when
we are already stranded outside?

00:20:05.090 --> 00:20:07.150
Shut up!

00:20:12.500 --> 00:20:17.120
Thank goodness you were
found before morning.

00:20:17.120 --> 00:20:20.190
Indeed. My apologies for the trouble.

00:20:21.600 --> 00:20:24.870
This will be your room, Professor Heine.

00:20:30.060 --> 00:20:32.950
Such a splendid room for
a commoner like me...

00:20:33.340 --> 00:20:34.910
Thank you.

00:20:34.910 --> 00:20:37.800
Make yourself at home.

00:20:48.130 --> 00:20:49.410
I can't sleep.

00:20:54.890 --> 00:20:57.080
It's too big for me to relax.

00:20:59.370 --> 00:21:00.200
Ah.

00:21:03.080 --> 00:21:04.670
Professor Heine.

00:21:04.670 --> 00:21:06.630
It's time to rise.

00:21:06.630 --> 00:21:07.700
Oh?

00:21:08.670 --> 00:21:10.550
Professor Heine...?

00:21:15.780 --> 00:21:17.050
Squish.

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:17.540
Squish

00:21:17.050 --> 00:21:19.730
P-Professor!

00:21:21.930 --> 00:21:26.860
I was unable to free myself,
and did not sleep a wink.

00:21:26.860 --> 00:21:31.210
I am a live-in tutor. I will need to
adapt to life in the palace quickly.

00:21:31.210 --> 00:21:34.340
Oh! Good morning, Professor Heine.

00:21:34.340 --> 00:21:35.930
Good morning to you.

00:21:39.280 --> 00:21:40.930
It's the little professor.

00:21:40.930 --> 00:21:43.590
I heard he was stuck between
his bed and the wall.

00:21:43.590 --> 00:21:45.020
That's so precious.

00:21:45.900 --> 00:21:48.570
Excuse me. Where is Prince Leonhard?

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:52.710
When I went to his room earlier,
His Highness was still asleep.

00:21:52.710 --> 00:21:56.030
I see. Thank you.

00:21:58.440 --> 00:22:00.570
Good morning. You're late.

00:22:01.790 --> 00:22:03.540
Prince Leonhard?

00:22:05.260 --> 00:22:06.780
Good morning.

00:22:07.360 --> 00:22:10.010
It's time for our lesson, Heine.

00:22:10.840 --> 00:22:12.250
Understood.

00:22:14.800 --> 00:22:17.280
I must admit, I'm surprised.

00:22:17.280 --> 00:22:20.080
I did not expect Your Highness
to be here before me.

00:22:20.080 --> 00:22:26.530
Hmph. I don't want to study,
and I don't accept you as the royal tutor.

00:22:28.000 --> 00:22:31.210
But I did say I'd try. So I will.

00:22:31.690 --> 00:22:33.500
Prince Leonhard...

00:22:34.070 --> 00:22:38.360
Then let us dive into your lessons.

00:22:38.360 --> 00:22:40.550
We will begin with simple
addition and subtraction.

00:22:40.550 --> 00:22:41.540
Okay.

00:22:42.140 --> 00:22:44.500
You have two minutes.

00:22:44.500 --> 00:22:46.280
All right!

00:22:46.680 --> 00:22:47.520
Begin.

00:22:50.250 --> 00:22:52.750
Your Highness, your two minutes are almost—

00:22:52.750 --> 00:22:54.010
For crying out loud!

00:22:54.010 --> 00:22:57.660
You have no sense of humor, Bruni.

00:22:57.660 --> 00:23:00.280
Well, you are in need of
an attitude adjustment!

00:23:00.280 --> 00:23:02.390
Stick in the mud! Numskull!

00:23:02.390 --> 00:23:03.390
Skirt-chaser!

00:23:03.740 --> 00:23:06.340
I'll straighten you out!

00:23:04.600 --> 00:23:06.680
Quarreling again?

00:23:06.340 --> 00:23:09.480
I'm not listening to you
and your over-sized head!

00:23:12.350 --> 00:23:13.780
Be good boys.

00:23:13.780 --> 00:23:16.510
No, Kai, we aren't quarreling.

00:23:16.510 --> 00:23:20.280
I'm pointing out Licht's faults
to him for his own good.

00:23:20.280 --> 00:23:22.970
Okay. Then you're getting along.

00:23:22.970 --> 00:23:25.590
Kai, don't let him fool you!

00:23:25.590 --> 00:23:30.140
Bruni has a nasty personality and always has
to find fault with me. That's all this is.

00:23:30.140 --> 00:23:30.840
Excuse me?!

00:23:30.840 --> 00:23:32.570
What? Am I wrong?

00:23:32.570 --> 00:23:33.460
Goodness gracious.

00:23:32.570 --> 00:23:33.950
I dare you to say that again!

00:23:33.460 --> 00:23:36.230
I have my work cut out for me.

00:23:35.530 --> 00:23:37.430
Why must you always be like this?

00:23:37.430 --> 00:23:38.450
Bleh!

00:23:39.550 --> 00:23:43.530
I'm pleased that you have also come to
appreciate Master's brilliance, Leonhard.

00:23:43.530 --> 00:23:44.550
I-I never said I...

00:23:44.550 --> 00:23:48.860
Come! You and I must have a passionate
chat about Master's brilliance!

00:23:48.130 --> 00:23:53.760
The Princes Go To Town

00:23:48.130 --> 00:23:53.760
Next Time:

00:23:48.860 --> 00:23:50.740
Next time, "The Princes Go to Town."

00:23:50.740 --> 00:23:53.910
Erm, Bruno... Can we do that later?
